When will God answer me? Maybe today. Maybe tomorrow. Or maybe when He is sure you have become. The journey is the reward and not the trophy. The trophy will always come. There are children, teenagers, and young adults who become millionaires. And there are others whose breakthroughs come much later. If you feel time is running out, pause, and consider these people who achieved significant success after the age of 40. I will start with yours truly. Nduka Omeife became successful with his yoghurt company at the age of 50+, after twenty-one years of trials, failures, resets, and persistence. Now, look at the rest: John Stith Pemberton – Invented Coca-Cola at 55 Julia Child – Published Mastering the Art of French Cooking at 50 Ray Kroc – Bought McDonald’s at 52 and turned it into a global empire Laura Ingalls Wilder – Published her first Little House book at 65 J.R.R. Tolkien – Published The Hobbit at 45 and completed The Lord of the Rings at 56 Colonel Harland Sanders – Franchised KFC at 62 Alan Rickman – Got his first major film role at 42 Samuel L. Jackson – Breakthrough role in Pulp Fiction at 46 Morgan Freeman – First major film success at 50 Viola Davis – First Oscar nomination at 43 Liam Neeson – Global recognition after Schindler’s List at 40 Sam Walton – Founded Walmart at 44 Henry Ford – Founded Ford Motor Company at 40 Vera Wang – Opened her first bridal boutique at 40 Chip Wilson – Founded Lululemon at 42 J.K. Rowling – Career breakthrough in her 30s after years of rejection Ian Fleming – Wrote the first James Bond novel at 44 Momofuku Ando – Invented instant noodles at 48 Stan Lee – Created Marvel’s iconic characters in his late 30s and 40s Bob Ross – Became a famous painter and instructor at 41 God is not slow. He is intentional. Delay is not denial. Sometimes, it is preparation. If your breakthrough hasn’t happened yet, it may be because you are still becoming the person who can sustain it. So keep building. Keep learning. Keep showing up. Your time is not gone. It is loading. And if it is capital he needs to start business let him reach out to Ayo 
@PureMinD__
 And let's see what we can do.

